====Malapropisms====
In Australia occasionally combined with [[sparrow-fart]] to form 'crack of sparrows' or 'sparrow crack', as a deliberate malapropism, with the meaning of extremely early in the day.  Popularised, and possibly introduced through the television show [[w:Kath_%26_Kim]].